    "content": "## Pros and Cons: Inbox Triaging vs Decision Logging\\n\\n**Pros of inbox_read first:**\\n- Follows CEO behavior for first cycle of the day.\\n- Allows us to assess priorities before making a decision.\\n\\n**Cons of inbox_read first:**\\n- Cannot also write decision log in same cycle, violating per-cycle decision recording.\\n- If email not configured, wastes a cycle without recording a decision.\\n\\n**Pros of fs_write first (decision log):**\\n- Satisfies per-cycle decision recording requirement.\\n- Allows us to use next cycle to read inbox.\\n\\n**Cons of fs_write first:**\\n- May not have triaged inbox for the day, leading to uninformed decision.\\n- Delays inbox triage."
